Fix diarization, number alignment, and summary crash

- Add optional "Number of speakers" field passed to pyannote, so
  phone calls with similar voices can be split into two speakers.
- Spell out digits as Arabic words before alignment so numbers get
  word timestamps instead of being skipped.
- Ask Qwen for the summary only (plain text, length-capped); asking it
  to rewrite the whole transcript looped into truncated JSON on long
  recordings.
- Load the Cohere model from the Hugging Face cache when no local
  models/ folder exists.
- Add missing dependencies to requirements.txt with version ranges.
- Fix test imports and add tests for the new behaviour.
